<title>JAPAN: Japan September imported vehicle sales rise 5.7%.</title>
<headline>Japan September imported vehicle sales rise 5.7%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales of imported vehicles in Japan rose 5.7 percent in September to 38,017 from a year earlier, the Japan Automobile Importers Association (JAIA) said on Friday.</p>
<p>							  SEP	 YR/YR PCT</p>
<p>  Cars						34,605	     +2.6</p>
<p>    - Over 2000 cc				24,020	     -6.9</p>
<p>    - Under 2000 cc			     10,585	    +33.8</p>
<p>  Trucks					     3,410	    +51.6</p>
<p>    - Heavy					  2,139	     -0.9</p>
<p>    - Light					  1,271	    vs 92</p>
<p>  Buses						    2	    vs  1</p>
